      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Scene-colored field with a lilac focus ring.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-form-field\"><label for=\"ds-email\">Email</label><input id=\"ds-email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" /></div>",
      "css": ".ds-form-field { margin-bottom:20px; } .ds-form-field label { display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:9px; } .ds-form-field input { width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s; } .ds-form-field input:focus { outline:none;border-color:var(--brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--brand-ring); } :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:4px; } @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { * { animation:none!important;transition:none!important; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Starter action",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "starter-action",
      "description": "Pointer-lit suggestion card; hover uses centered light without the application pointer handler.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-starter-action\"><span class=\"ds-starter-icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 7 9-5 9 5v10l-9 5-9-5V7Zm0 0 9 5 9-5M12 12v10\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-starter-copy\"><strong>Follow an order</strong><span>Try example order FK1001</span></span><span class=\"ds-starter-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">?</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-starter-action { position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-align:left;padding:17px 18px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s,transform .25s var(--ease-ui); } .ds-starter-action:before { content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(150px circle at var(--pointer-x,50%) var(--pointer-y,50%),var(--brand-ring),transparent 75%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s;pointer-events:none; } .ds-starter-action:hover:not(:disabled):before { opacity:1; } .ds-starter-action:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color:var(--brand);transform:translateY(-2px); } .ds-starter-action:disabled { cursor:not-allowed; } .ds-starter-icon { color:var(--brand);flex-shrink:0;display:flex; } .ds-starter-action:nth-child(2) .ds-starter-icon,.ds-starter-action:nth-child(4) .ds-starter-icon { color:var(--accent); } .ds-starter-copy { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0;z-index:1; } .ds-starter-copy strong { font-size:13px;font-weight:550;color:var(--ink); } .ds-starter-copy>span { font-size:11px;color:var(--muted); } .ds-starter-arrow { margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0; } .ds-starter-action { transition:background-color .3s var(--ease-ui),border-color .25s,color .25s; } .ds-starter-action { transition:background-color .3s,border-color .2s,transform .25s var(--ease-ui); } :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:4px; } @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { * { animation:none!important;transition:none!important; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Composer suggestion",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "composer-chip",
      "description": "Small bordered question shortcut.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-composer-chip\">Track order</button>",
      "css": ".ds-composer-chips { display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px; } .ds-composer-chip { border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted);border-radius:7px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;transition:color .2s,border-color .2s; } .ds-composer-chip:hover:not(:disabled) { color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand); } :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:4px; } @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { * { animation:none!important;transition:none!important; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Message composer",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "Surface-grouped textarea and send action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer-inner\"><textarea class=\"ds-composer-field\" rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Your message\" placeholder=\"Ask about an order, refund, or policy?\"></textarea><button class=\"ds-composer-send\" aria-label=\"Send message\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5m-7 7 7-7 7 7\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer-inner { display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:13px 12px 13px 19px;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s; } .ds-composer-inner:focus-within { border-color:var(--brand);box-shadow:0 5px 22px var(--scene-lilac); } .ds-composer-field { width:100%;min-width:0;flex:1;resize:none;border:0;outline:none!important;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;line-height:22px;padding:6px 0;max-height:132px; } .ds-composer-send { height:36px;width:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--button-ink);transition:background .2s,transform .2s; } .ds-composer-send:hover:not(:disabled) { background:var(--brand-hover);transform:translateY(-1px); } .ds-composer-send:disabled { background:var(--muted-surface);color:var(--muted); } .ds-composer-field { max-height:144px; } .ds-composer-inner { transition:background-color .3s var(--ease-ui),border-color .25s,color .25s; } :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:4px; } @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { * { animation:none!important;transition:none!important; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Theme navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Three pressed-state controls; preview retains semantic state without a theme runtime.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-theme-switch\" aria-label=\"Color theme\"><button aria-label=\"Light\" aria-pressed=\"false\">?</button><button aria-label=\"Dark\" aria-pressed=\"true\">?</button><button aria-label=\"System\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8m-4-4v4\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-theme-switch { display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:3px;border-radius:9px; } .ds-theme-switch button { display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;width:29px;height:29px;color:var(--muted);background:transparent;border-radius:6px;transition:background .18s,color .18s; } .ds-theme-switch button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background:var(--brand-soft);color:var(--brand); } .ds-theme-switch button:hover { color:var(--brand); } :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:4px; } @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { * { animation:none!important;transition:none!important; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Orbital aperture",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "The shipped SVG star and elliptical orbit signature, with slow rotation and breathing.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-aperture\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ds-aperture-haze\"></div><svg class=\"ds-aperture-rings\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 180\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse class=\"ds-aperture-ring ds-ring-one\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"102\" ry=\"48\"/><ellipse class=\"ds-aperture-ring ds-ring-two\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"102\" ry=\"48\"/><ellipse class=\"ds-aperture-ring ds-ring-three\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"102\" ry=\"48\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"84\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"var(--accent)\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-aperture-core\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 3C20 14 26 20 37 20C26 20 20 26 20 37C20 26 14 20 3 20C14 20 20 14 20 3Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"3\" fill=\"var(--bg)\"/></svg></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-aperture { width:210px;height:145px;position:relative;flex-shrink:0; }.ds-aperture-haze { position:absolute;inset:10px 15px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,var(--scene-lilac),transparent 65%);filter:blur(12px); }.ds-aperture-rings { width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible;animation:ds-aperture-turn 45s linear infinite; }.ds-aperture-ring { transform-origin:120px 90px;stroke-width:.8;stroke:var(--brand);opacity:.32; }.ds-ring-one { transform:rotate(-30deg); }.ds-ring-two { transform:rotate(30deg);stroke:var(--accent); }.ds-ring-three { transform:rotate(90deg);opacity:.2; }.ds-aperture-core { position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:54px;height:54px;color:var(--brand);animation:ds-aperture-breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 15px var(--scene-lilac)); }.ds-aperture-core svg { width:100%;height:100%; }@keyframes ds-aperture-turn { from { transform:rotate(0); } to { transform:rotate(360deg); } }@keyframes ds-aperture-breathe { 0%,100% { transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1); } 50% { transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1.08); } }@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .ds-aperture-rings,.ds-aperture-core { animation:none!important; } }"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Aster Aperture",
    "overview": "Aster gives customer support an independent, cinematic identity. A small star sits within delicate orbital rings, with lilac and apricot light diffusing across aubergine surfaces. The user approved color, typography, effects, and animation as the foremost expression of this identity. The imagery is generated directly in SVG and CSS; no image compositions are part of the shipped system.\n\nLarge Outfit headings create an expressive first impression. DM Sans carries the practical work of questions, answers, history, and forms. Atmospheric welcome screens resolve into legible, bounded conversation surfaces. The signature stays consistent across entry, saved chat, and anonymous demo experiences.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Aubergine foundations, lilac actions, and apricot punctuation.",
      "Orbital SVG geometry with a star-shaped core.",
      "Broad, soft scene light with restrained surface borders.",
      "Pointer-lit starter actions and slow ambient motion.",
      "Light, dark, and system modes with reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Theme Roles Rule",
        "body": "Use runtime CSS variables for colors. Explicit light and dark selections override the OS; system mode follows `prefers-color-scheme`. Dark is the initial fallback, and the chosen mode is stored under `theme`.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Atmospheric Depth Rule",
        "body": "Keep ordinary panels grounded in their surface and border roles; reserve visible glow for the orbital signature, pointer response, and focus.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reduced Motion Rule",
        "body": "Under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, disable animations and transitions and use automatic scrolling. The welcome remains sharp and stationary; the identity remains visible without motion.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use runtime theme variables so surfaces, text, status, and glow adapt together.",
      "Do keep Outfit on expressive headings and DM Sans on practical reading and controls.",
      "Do reuse the star, elliptical orbit, lilac light, and apricot punctuation across entry and chat.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do retain the implemented width and height adaptations, including the final cascade overrides."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't hard-code dark-only colors into shared components.",
      "Don't replace the shipped code-led orbital signature with an unrelated image treatment.",
      "Don't apply welcome-scale ambient motion to message reading surfaces.",
      "Don't make connection readiness, errors, or example data rely on decorative color alone."
    ]
  }
}
